---
source: crates/forgejo-core/src/error/classify.rs
expression: "rendered(404, &json(),\nbr#\"[\"could not find 'no-such-branch' to be a commit, branch or tag, or the branch does not exist\"]\"#,\n&c)"
---
error: repository or resource not found under perf3ct/fjo on git.example.org (HTTP 404)

  request:      POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fjo/pulls
  repository:   perf3ct/fjo  (not checked)
  host:         git.example.org
  logged in as: (not logged in)
  server says:  could not find 'no-such-branch' to be a commit, branch or tag, or the branch does not exist

what to do:
  the repository check was disabled or failed. The repository or a referenced
  resource may be missing.
  1. fjo api repos/perf3ct/fjo  (check repository access)
  2. another 404 may mean the repository is missing, private with a token
     that lacks read:repository, or on another server. Check: fjo auth status
  3. if it succeeds, check the resources referenced by the request:
     branch, tag, or user names
